<a href="#S5.T2.9.1.11.1" title="In 5.2.1 Motion Inpainting with Trajectory Control ‣ 5.2 Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ ProjFlow: Projection Sampling with Flow Matching for Zero‑Shot Exact Spatial Motion Control" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 2</span></a>,
<a href="#S5.T2.9.1.6.1" title="In 5.2.1 Motion Inpainting with Trajectory Control ‣ 5.2 Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ ProjFlow: Projection Sampling with Flow Matching for Zero‑Shot Exact Spatial Motion Control" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 2</span></a>.
</span></li>
