<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Additional qualitative results.</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The supplementary material includes a browsable demo page that collects our qualitative videos (open <span id="A5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">index.html</span> in a web browser). This page organizes examples by task: the four control scenarios from Fig.<a href="#S0.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ ProjFlow: Projection Sampling with Flow Matching for Zero‑Shot Exact Spatial Motion Control" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, trajectory-control benchmarks comparing ProjFlow with OmniControl<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">63</a>]</cite> and MaskControl<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">63</a>]</cite>, and 2D-to-3D lifting comparisons against Sketch2Anim<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">68</a>]</cite>. We refer readers to this page for a more complete visual impression of ProjFlow’s behavior.</p>
</div>
</section>
</article>
</div>
